OL,3,AChildminder who left more than 20
OL,4,Achildren alone in her home jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA childminder who admitted leaving more
OL,7,Fthan 20 children she was caring for
OL,8,Falone and unsupervised in her home has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed for two years.
OL,11,FAmanda Mathewson, 55, pled guilty to
OL,12,Fwilfully neglecting, abandoning and
OL,13,Fexposing children in a manner likely to
OL,14,Fcause them unnecessary suffering or
OL,15,Finjury to their health at her home in
OL,16,FDunfermline, Fife in August 2024.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
