OL,3,AChildminder who left more than 20
OL,4,Achildren alone in her home jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn internal Care Inspectorate probe
OL,7,Ffound Mathewson, who was been licensed
OL,8,Fto look after eight children under the
OL,9,Fage of 16 at any one time, had been
OL,10,Ftipped off about unannounced
OL,11,Finspections by an unknown staff member.
OL,13,FHer offending only came to light after
OL,14,Fconcerned parents spied on her leaving
OL,15,Fthe home without their children.
